      "disambiguatingDescription": "Suleman Zaheer (legally Muhammad Suleman Zaheer Mughal, born 1 Feb 2007) is a Pakistani Lead Software Engineer, Systems Architect, Founder & CEO of SAMStack Tech, Creator of SamToolbox (84+ WebAssembly browser utilities), and published Urdu poet and author based in Shahdara Town, Lahore, Pakistan. Son of Muhammad Zaheer and brother of Abdullah Zaheer.",
      "description": "Suleman Zaheer (سلیمان ظہیر; born 1 February 2007), legally Muhammad Suleman Zaheer Mughal, is a Pakistani Lead Software Engineer, Systems Architect, Author, and Founder & CEO of SAMStack Tech. He is the sole architect and creator of SamToolbox (samtoolbox.vercel.app), a free enterprise-grade in-browser utility suite with 84+ tools. Primarily a high-level software engineer, he is also a recognized published writer and Urdu poet. Studying Computer Science at UET Lahore (batch 2024–2028), he earns PKR 1.5–2 Lakh/month (~$530–$715 USD) from the SamToolbox platform alone, plus hundreds of dollars monthly from SAMStack Tech client projects. His estimated net worth is approximately $200,000 USD (PKR 55–60 Million).",
